          "distinct": true,
          "id": "599bde1c936754dc47c1f567552ef580ca357427",
          "message": "fix(velvet)!: dnd-kit parity for drag and drop (#1453)\n\nCloses #1124\n\n## What changed\n- Hooks `UseDraggable` / `UseDroppable` / `UseDndContext` / `UseDndMonitor`.\n- `DndSensor` / `DndSensorSession` sensor API; `DndKeyboardSensor` with announcements.\n- Droppables on other screen-space runtime panels are collision candidates.\n- `V.SortableContext` / `V.Sortable` / `UseSortable` with four strategies and `ArrayMove`.\n- Modifiers, auto-scroll, `DndDropAnimation`; `V.DragOverlay` renders in place in editor mounts.\n\nBreaking changes are recorded in `Changelog~/breaking/fix-1124-dnd-parity-sensors.md`. `Documentation~` is updated alongside.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01FoK7YxdRjMGmfmRkEEmS88)_",
