          "id": "a772a79face5031bae82bbe12210923fd9997926",
          "message": "test(velvet): correct the base-green declarations recent changes added (#1477)\n\n## What & why\n\nRecent changes added 182 `GREEN_ON_BASE` declarations. Many stated a reason the merge-base code does not bear out, and some were spliced mid-sentence into existing declarations. Each one was checked against its PR's merge base:\n\n- **Rewritten (130):** the reason now says what actually changed under the case.\n  - In `GestureClassManipulatorTests`, `GradientBoxAspectTests` and `PaintBindingPatchTests`: the deleted painted-skew and silhouette-bake cases and helpers.\n  - In `FilterSpacerTests`: a container class moved from a skew to `shadow-lg`.\n  - In `SilhouetteBoundsSpacerTests`: the forwarding `SkewSilhouette.SuppressedColor` read is replaced by `SilhouetteFace`.\n  - Also the Suspense, weaver-probe and redirect cases.\n- **Removed (37, `LiveClassListOrderTests`):** the cases are unchanged and not posed to the base, so they owe no declaration. The spliced sentences are taken out, and earlier declarations are restored to their prior text.\n- **Sharpened (1):** `RouterNotFoundTests...TheErrorIsCleared` also asserts the 404 error while the not-found location stands, so it no longer holds on a router that never commits one.\n- **Kept (4):** their reasons were verified true.\n\nTest comments and one test only; no doc or changelog impact.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Tests pass locally (EditMode / PlayMode / generator tests as applicable) — Unity suites run in CI\n- [x] New regression tests were verified red without the change and green with it — via the base-red lane\n- [x] Docs are updated for every fact this change touches (guides, READMEs, CLAUDE.md) — or this PR has no doc impact\n- [x] CHANGELOG fragment added for behavior/perf changes, named for the branch with `/` as `-` — inline under `## [Unreleased]` on a maintenance line with no `scripts/release/compile_changelog.py` (pure refactors are omitted by convention)\n- [x] Known gaps or deliberate deferrals discovered here are filed as issues with acceptance criteria\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01FoK7YxdRjMGmfmRkEEmS88)_",
