          "message": "test(velvet): make the min-size and skew-stylesheet cases fail on the base for the reason they test (#1476)\n\n## What & why\n\nSome cases added for the min-size floor and the skew-stylesheet compose read green on the merge base, or red for the wrong reason, so they did not show the change working.\n\n- **`TextItemBaselinePanelTests`:**\n  - The overflow-variant case passed on the base, because a geometry event alone re-derived the floor. It is replaced by a case that applies an `overflow-hidden` variant payload outside any patch. Only the variant rescan releases the floor there.\n  - The two `[auto]`-patched-away cases carried base-green declarations whose stated mechanism the base does not have. They now also assert the floor held before the patch, which the base never writes under an `[auto]` bracket. The declarations are removed.\n  - The scale-after-auto group keeps its declaration, with a reason cut to what the base code makes true.\n- **`SkewStylesheetCompositePanelTests`:** the base lane carries test-side `.cs` files but not a fixture's `.uss`. On the base the sheet never loaded, and every case read NaN. The rules now live in the fixture, which writes and imports the sheet itself, so the base reading measures the drawn matrix.\n\nTest-only; no doc or changelog impact.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Tests pass locally (EditMode / PlayMode / generator tests as applicable) — Unity suites run in CI\n- [x] New regression tests were verified red without the change and green with it — via the base-red lane\n- [x] Docs are updated for every fact this change touches (guides, READMEs, CLAUDE.md) — or this PR has no doc impact\n- [x] CHANGELOG fragment added for behavior/perf changes, named for the branch with `/` as `-` — inline under `## [Unreleased]` on a maintenance line with no `scripts/release/compile_changelog.py` (pure refactors are omitted by convention)\n- [x] Known gaps or deliberate deferrals discovered here are filed as issues with acceptance criteria\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01FoK7YxdRjMGmfmRkEEmS88)_",
